    "title": "Nomad eSIM 할인코드 (2026년 10월) | 20% 쿠폰·신규 추천 $5 할인",
    "content": "<div class=\"ncp-feed-preview\" data-ncp-feed-preview aria-label=\"Nomad eSIM 할인 요약\">\n  <div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>현재 공개 할인</span><strong>20%</strong></div>\n  <div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>신규 추천 할인</span><strong>$5</strong></div>\n  <div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>업데이트</span><strong>10월 7일</strong></div>\n</div>\n<!--more-->\n<article data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\" class=\"ncp-commerce-article\">\n<style>\n.ncp-feed-preview{display:none!important}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"]{--ink:#1f2937;--muted:#667085;--line:#e5e7eb;--soft:#f8fafc;--brand:#111827;--ok:#067647;--warn:#b54708;color:var(--ink);font-size:16px;line-height:1.72}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] *{box-sizing:border-box}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] h1{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,38px);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-.035em}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] h2{margin:36px 0 14px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.025em}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] p{margin:0 0 14px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] .ncp-hero{margin:0 0 24px;padding-bottom:22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] .ncp-meta{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] .ncp-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:4px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;font-weight:750;color:#475467}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] .ncp-lead{font-size:17px;color:#344054}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] .ncp-quickbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:0 0 28px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"nomad-esim-promo-202610\"] .ncp-